 torn←Board rdelay
⍝ The "seats-left" board an auditor watches. It returns 1 if the board is torn, 0 if
⍝ not. Torn means SOLD and the real count +/SEATS disagree. Both are read on one line,
⍝ so the read itself is clean; it reports 1 when it lands between Book claiming a seat
⍝ and Book bumping the count.
⍝ rdelay stands in for the time to render a report. It is 0 except in ScenarioC.
⍝ TODO: an auditor can read the board while a Book is part-way through.
 torn←SOLD≠+/SEATS
